      "text": "The UNGA vote is symbolically powerful but practically limited. General Assembly resolutions aren't binding, and the US veto at the Security Council means Palestinian statehood through the UN remains blocked regardless of how many countries support it. That said, the 143-9 margin is striking \u2014 it demonstrates how isolated the US-Israel position is on this issue globally. The diplomatic trajectory is clear even if the political mechanism is stuck.",
